43c519a1 (5 1792170025029 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing code-markers CR") (src . "code-markers: a last line that ends in CR before a pad is escaped\n\nThe projection encoder judged each body row's marker family on the row as\nit stood, and a last row without a line end kept its carriage return in the\ntext it judged. A row whose content was a marker line but for that carriage\nreturn was left unescaped; the pad line end that frames the next block\nfollowed it, and the file then held the marker's closing, CR and LF, which\nevery line reader, the decoder included, took for a marker: the decode\nfailed with invalid-padding. The encoder now judges the last row without its\ncarriage return when a pad follows and writes the carriage return after the\nescaped row. The decoder needs no change: it sees the content and CR LF and\nunescapes as before. code-markers1 reads the round trip, the last-block twin\nthat must stay unescaped, the insertion map through projection-range, and\nthe directive lines that end in CR.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 404))))
